@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### My projects (owner comes from the token)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/projects/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a project
POST http://localhost:3001/api/projects/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "REST client test project",
  "projectDescription": "created from projects.http",
  "componentCount": 3,
  "projectSizeKB": 2,
  "projectData": "{\"ROOT\":{}}"
}

### One project
GET http://localhost:3001/api/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a project (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
